WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.898 --> 00:00:19.711
Everything an instructor does starts from the kiosk.

2
00:00:19.711 --> 00:00:27.122
Tap Management, in the row under the two big buttons.

3
00:00:27.122 --> 00:00:30.311
The panel is behind your instructor PIN.

4
00:00:30.311 --> 00:00:34.544
Face ID is the shortcut — the PIN is what actually opens it.

5
00:00:34.544 --> 00:00:40.220
Type your PIN.

6
00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:45.701
Then tap Unlock.

7
00:00:45.701 --> 00:00:51.431
This is the Instructor Panel: Records, Add New and Export.

8
00:00:51.431 --> 00:00:57.393
Open the Add New tab.

9
00:00:57.393 --> 00:01:04.297
It is a table: last name, first name, and a phone number if you have one.

10
00:01:04.297 --> 00:01:15.024
Type the first attendee into row one.

11
00:01:15.024 --> 00:01:20.849
The Status column says Ready once both names are in.

12
00:01:20.849 --> 00:01:29.474
The phone is optional. Row two has none.

13
00:01:29.474 --> 00:01:37.150
The button counts the rows that are ready. Tap it.

14
00:01:37.150 --> 00:01:45.467
The line underneath says what happened. Names are never duplicated.
